# Device timezone offset
# Read by scripts/update_timezone.sh at service start to set the TZ environment
# variable used by BusyBox date/cron/syslog.
#
# Format: UTC±HH or UTC±HH:MM
#   UTC+0    — Greenwich Mean Time / UTC (default)
#   UTC-5    — US Eastern Standard Time
#   UTC-8    — US Pacific Standard Time
#   UTC+1    — Central European Time
#   UTC+5:30 — India Standard Time
#
# Daylight-saving time adjustments are NOT applied automatically; update
# this value manually when clocks change, or use UTC to avoid the issue.
UTC+0
